      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here is a potential fix for the devs, \n\nIt should not show the same ui element that indicates platform compatibility, they can probably fix the comprehension of this nameplate element by only showing one circle by itself at a time rather than the same element which has both circles that is used to show platform compatibility.\n\nI dont expect this to ever be changed but I am having a good laugh over this for sure because I can see how confusing it might be.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
