      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a7ac88bf5a5c52c08064fb9|full_name}: I agree that using this same icon in different places is confusing. It represents content compatibility for avatars and worlds, but the double circle with one grated does not make sense for displaying which platform a user is on.",
